ers of different classes as easily as lone heroes; analyze and predict your odds in deterministic auto-battles that seamlessly run on the same world map where you build towns.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854570/extras/d7055290abd348c60c48dace4699be10.webp?t=1753777654\" /></div><br><br>Your empire will fall as they always do. But you will be able to start over and apply what you just learned. However, each time you will explore a completely different world with unique procedurally generated landscapes, civilizations, and natural resources. You will have to experiment and adjust your strategy to reach the main objective (or one of the many secret ones). <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854570/extras/f875b6d032ccea8c9a4f8652fc07e020.webp?t=1753777654\" /></div><br><br>You can team up with your friends in main roguelike game mode, or skirmish with them in a competitive game mode. Turns are simultaneous, cancellable, and don't depend on player reaction speed: carefully plan your actions using built-in prediction mechanisms.<br><br>Construct citadels, raise economies, nurture heroes!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854570/extras/a7208b4ac1afd73987fff5c488c28b43.poster.avif?t=1753777654\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854570/extras/a7208b4ac1afd73987fff5c488c28b43.webm?t=1753777654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854570/extras/a7208b4ac1afd73987fff5c488c28b43.mp4?t=1753777654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
